PasskeyMethodDeclarationsTest
├── when trusted parties are read
│   └── it should answer the zero address for every role and an empty key list
├── when asked for the IPolicyMethod interface id
│   └── it should answer true
├── when asked for the ERC165 interface id
│   └── it should answer true
├── when asked for the invalid interface id
│   └── it should answer false
├── when asked for the pause interface id
│   └── it should answer false
├── when asked for the admin interface id
│   └── it should answer false
├── when the pause read is made
│   └── it should not answer the encoding of true
├── when the name is read
│   └── it should answer method-passkey
├── when the version is read
│   └── it should answer 1.0.0
└── when a proof is verified
    └── it should touch no storage slot
